<title>USA: BCT International Q2 loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>BCT International Q2 loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q2 ended Aug 31, 1996.</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.07   profit	$ 0.02</p>
<p> Net loss		     449   profit	   231</p>
<p> Revs			 4,386		    4,542</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	 4,983		    4,569</p>
<p>	   6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		  $ 0.09   profit	 $0.07</p>
<p> Net loss		     540   profit	   536</p>
<p> Revs			 9,146		    8,500</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	 4,973		    4,569</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The company reported operating losses related to company plants held for resale amounting to $221,000 and $417,000 for the three months and six months ended Aug 31, 1996.</p>
